<title>USA: GOLF-FINAL ROUND SCORES AT NISSAN OPEN.</title>
<headline>GOLF-FINAL ROUND SCORES AT NISSAN OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>PACIFIC PALISADES, California 1997-03-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scores</p>
<p>after the final round of the $1.4 million Nissan Open golf</p>
<p>tournament on Sunday (players U.S. unless stated):</p>
<p>272 Nick Faldo (Britain) 66 70 68 68</p>
<p>275 Craig Stadler 71 66 68 70</p>
<p>276 Scott Hoch 65 71 71 69</p>
<p>277 Fred Funk 67 71 71 68, Tom Purtzer 67 71 69 70</p>
<p>278 Omar Uresti 70 71 69 68, Robin Freeman 69 71 68 70, Scott</p>
<p>McCarron 68 73 64 73</p>
<p>279 David Ogrin 68 71 72 68, Peter Jacobsen 68 75 68 68, Ted</p>
<p>Tryba 70 66 74 69, Paul Goydos 66 74 70 69, Joe Ozaki 73 69 68</p>
<p>69, Payne Stewart 65 72 72 70, Fred Couples 68 70 70 71, Mark</p>
<p>O'Meara 67 69 72 71</p>
<p>280 Jeff Maggert 69 71 72 68, Frank Nobilo (New Zealand) 71</p>
<p>70 70 69, Steve Pate 71 72 67 70</p>
<p>281 Ed Dougherty 69 75 69 68, Tiger Woods 70 70 72 69, Larry</p>
<p>Nelson 71 72 69 69, Brent Geiberger 74 69 68 70, Willie Wood</p>
<p>71 68 72 70, Don Pooley 67 68 75 71, Bob Tway 73 71 66 71</p>
<p>Add non-U.S. scores</p>
<p>283 Hideki Kase (Japan) 73 71 70 69</p>
<p>285 Rafael Alarcon (Mexico) 70 69 75 71</p>
<p>287 Phil Taturangi (New Zealand) 73 70 70 74, T.C. Chen</p>
<p>(Taiwan) 72 71 72 72, Yoshinori Kaneko 70 72 77 68</p>
</text>
